[Splunk Detection Queries - AD & Sysmon Lab]

---
### 1. Detect Suspicious PowerShell Execution (Event ID 1)
index=sysmon EventCode=1 
| search Image="*\\powershell.exe" CommandLine="*-enc*" OR CommandLine="*DownloadString*"
| table _time ComputerName User Image CommandLine ParentImage

---
### 2. Detect Potential Kerberoasting (Active Directory Event ID 4769)
index=wineventlog EventCode=4769 ServiceName!="*$" TicketEncryptionType=0x17
| stats count by AccountName ClientAddress ServiceName
| sort - count

---
### 3. Detect LSASS Process Access / Credential Dumping (Sysmon Event ID 10)
index=sysmon EventCode=10 TargetImage="*\\lsass.exe" 
| stats count by ComputerName SourceImage GrantedAccess
| sort - count
